- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
Version: 1.4.0 [2010-01-04]
o BUG FIX: After loading aroma.affymetrix, findCdf() would give "Error in
  if (regexpr(pattern, chipType) != -1) { : argument is of length zero",
